  "description": "Stop wiring Serilog by hand. Add 3 lines of JSON and every ILogger<T> routes logs where they belong — errors to Email, info to Console, traces to Seq. 9 sinks, zero boilerplate. New in 5.0.8: declarative sensitive-data masking enricher redacts emails, credit cards, JWT/Bearer tokens and connection-string passwords from every sink at once — one JSON block, zero code changes.",
